# Orchestrator env — documents the SHAPE only. Never commit real secrets.
#
# Step 1 needs no secrets: agents run via the ambient Claude Code auth
# (ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL + OAuth token) already present in the environment.
#
# Later steps add:
#   SERENA_* / MCP config   (Step 2 — shared store)
#   GRAPHIFY_* / MCP config  (Step 5-nav — code navigation)
#   RAILWAY_*                (Step 6 — headless deploy)
#
# If you run this outside Claude Code, provide model access explicitly:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=
